ng\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琉璃百合\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/70e9deaddfc2f39a71b8f4257001bc78_4247746153843528709.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琉璃百合\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e50000\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e3（每月）\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呀，你好！像你这样的年轻人近来很少见呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e【你这里卖什么？】——打开商店界面\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要来些豆腐吗？我家的豆腐保你满意！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e【你好。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e叫我小白就好，这里是我的磨坊⋯嘿嘿，准确来说，是我管理的磨坊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e怎么样，很不错吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【关于磨坊。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e怎么样？这是我父亲留下来的，我一回来就把他整饬一新，每天都在维护它。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e或许父亲曾经也是过着这样平静的生活吧⋯每次听着水车的声音，总让我想起童年的很多往事⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【挺不错的。】——获得\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"791\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/11/24/24077343/d380e079dbb2a42f9478e5351b1930e0_4191689326767980231.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"豆腐\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"8\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/791/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/791/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/11/24/24077343/d380e079dbb2a42f9478e5351b1930e0_4191689326767980231.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e豆腐\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*8\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e谢谢你的夸奖，不只是磨坊，我家的豆腐也绝对是璃月最好的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽然听上去有些像是自夸，但连璃月港的很多餐馆、甚至连望舒客栈都会来我这里进货呢！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然，说得再好听也不如亲自尝尝，这些豆腐就送给你好了，如果觉得不错就再来买些吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e【年轻人？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，是啊。年轻人们大多出去打工，不再回来了。外来的年轻游客也很少见呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e果然还是城市里的生活更吸引人吧⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e【再见。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e再见，一路平安！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手九级解锁】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e从没见过这种打法！难道⋯城市里有很多和你一样强的牌手吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我的牌组还不错吧？我可是拿出了管理磨坊的干劲在管理它哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"【冒险挑战】：镖师的战果","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"小白\",\"created_at\":\"2023.10.26\",\"list\":[{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":6634,\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/27/12233500/e4a82f15ee4fe4912ac01b83b2ff76cb_8062618957482972961.png\",\"life\":4,\"life_bg\":11,\"link\":\"/ys/obc/content/6634/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"},{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":5593,\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/27/12233500/0fc5b9531aaf27ed0904acd4cc6237a8_1113002190654703580.png\",\"life\":8,\"life_bg\":11,\"link\":\"/ys/obc/content/5593/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"},{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":5591,\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/27/12233500/084fbb351267f4a6eb5b4eb167cebe51_8636765733577974469.png\",\"life\":3,\"life_bg\":11,\"link\":\"/ys/obc/content/5591/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"},{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":5594,\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/27/12233500/19ea96977b7722d9f379227497327d15_8820019001708942922.png\",\"life\":3,\"life_bg\":11,\"link\":\"/ys/obc/content/5594/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"},{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":5592,\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/27/12233500/ba55e6e19d419b16ec763dfcfb655834_2415867962015091300.png\",\"life\":3,\"life_bg\":11,\"link\":\"/ys/obc/content/5592/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"},{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":6634,\"img\":\"ht